ineering\" team section\n182:- **Expected**: User is navigated to the projects page filtered by this team, or to `/projects` with the team filter applied.\n184:#### Test: Sidebar team Views link navigates to saved views\n185:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, \"Engineering\" team has id \"eng-1\"\n186:- **Action**: User clicks \"Views\" under the \"Engineering\" team section\n187:- **Expected**: User is navigated to a views page for the team showing saved filtered views.\n191:- **Expected**: The sidebar displays a \"Workspace\" section with links: \"All Projects\" (folder icon), \"All Teams\" (users icon), \"Members\" (user-plus icon), \"Labels\" (tag icon), \"Settings\" (settings icon).\n198:#### Test: Sidebar All Teams link navigates correctly\n200:- **Action**: User clicks \"All Teams\" in the workspace section\n201:- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/settings/teams`.\n273:#### Test: Sidebar team sections visible in collapsed mode\n274:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, sidebar is in icon-only mode, workspace has team \"Engineering\"\n275:- **Expected**: Team navigation items are still accessible in icon-only mode (icons for Issues, Active Cycle, Projects, Views are visible and clickable).\n279:- **Expected**: Workspace section items (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings) are visible as icons and remain clickable.\n593:## Team Issues Page (`/team/:teamId/issues`)\n595:**Components**: TeamIssuesList, BulkActions, GroupBySort, TeamFilters\n597:### TeamIssuesList\n599:#### Test: Team Issues page renders with header showing team name\n600:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, navigates to `/team/eng-1/issues` for team \"Engineering\"\n601:- **Expected**: The page displays a header with the team name \"Engineering\" and an \"Issues\" label. A \"New Issue\" button is visible in the header area.\n603:#### Test: Team Issues page shows issues grouped by status (default)\n604:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, \"Engineering\" team has issues in Backlog (3), In Progress (2), Done (1)\n607:#### Test: Team Issues page shows all team issues, not just current user's\n608:- **Initial state**: User \"Alice\" is authenticated, \"Engineering\" team has issues: ENG-1 (assigned to Alice), ENG-2 (assigned to Bob), ENG-3 (unassigned)\n609:- **Expected**: All three issues (ENG-1, ENG-2, ENG-3) are visible on the team issues page.\n611:#### Test: Team Issues page shows empty state when team has no issues\n612:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, \"Engineering\" team has no issues\n615:#### Test: Issue row displays all required fields including checkbox and team prefix\n616:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, viewing team issues. Issue ENG-42 exists with title \"Fix login bug\", status \"In Progress\", priority \"High\", labels [\"Bug\"], assignee \"Jane Doe\" (with avatar), due date \"2026-03-20\", project \"Auth Rewrite\".\n617:- **Expected**: The issue row displays: a checkbox for bulk selection (unchecked), High priority icon (orange arrow-up), identifier \"ENG-42\" with team prefix, title \"Fix login bug\", In Progress status icon (yellow half circle), \"Bug\" label as a small colored badge, assignee avatar, due date \"Mar 20\", and project name \"Auth Rewrite\".","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AmdR2s5MQnJFBCwwZ4P9wP","session_id":"64cf2708-249b-4134-8592-7c4f6164677a","uuid":"2053aceb-0204-4f33-a93f-b41a3f47fd20"}
