ercase, strips non-letter chars\n- Limits identifier to 5 chars max (via maxLength)\n- Submits on Enter key\n- Closes on Escape key or backdrop click\n- Resets form when opened/closed\n- Shows \"Creating...\" button state during submission\n\n---\n\n### 5. Team Settings Component\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamSettings.tsx`\n\n**Features:**\n- Edit team name, identifier, description (inline)\n- Add/remove team members\n- Delete team with confirmation\n\n**Key Data-TestIds:**\n- `team-settings` - Main container\n- `team-settings-back-btn` - Back to Teams button\n- `team-settings-name-field` - Name field\n- `team-settings-name-input` - Name input (edit mode)\n- `team-settings-name-value` - Name display (view mode)\n- `team-settings-name-error` - Name error\n- `team-settings-identifier-field` - Identifier field\n- `team-settings-identifier-input` - Identifier input (edit mode)\n- `team-settings-identifier-value` - Identifier display (view mode)\n- `team-settings-identifier-error` - Identifier error\n- `team-settings-description-field` - Description field\n- `team-settings-description-input` - Description textarea (edit mode)\n- `team-settings-description-value` - Description display (view mode)\n- `team-settings-members-section` - Members section\n- `team-settings-add-member-btn` - Add Member button\n- `team-settings-member-selector` - Member dropdown selector\n- `team-settings-add-member-option-{memberId}` - Member option in dropdown\n- `team-settings-members-list` - Members list\n- `team-settings-member-{memberId}` - Individual member row\n- `team-settings-remove-member-{memberId}` - Remove button\n- `team-settings-confirm-remove-{memberId}` - Confirm remove button\n- `team-settings-cancel-remove-{memberId}` - Cancel remove button\n- `team-settings-members-empty` - Empty members state\n- `team-settings-danger-zone` - Delete section\n- `team-settings-delete-btn` - Delete Team button\n- `team-settings-delete-confirm` - Delete confirmation dialog\n- `team-settings-confirm-delete-btn` - Confirm delete button\n- `team-settings-cancel-delete-btn` - Cancel delete button\n\n**Inline Editing:**\n- Click field to edit, blur or Enter to save\n- Escape to cancel\n- Shows error on failed validation\n- Auto-saves on blur\n\n---\n\n### 6. Existing Test Files\n\nLocated in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n\n1. **team-issues.spec.ts** - Main team issues list tests\n   - Header rendering with team name\n   - Issues grouped by status (default)\n   - All team issues displayed (not just assigned)\n   - Empty state\n   - Status group collapsible behavior\n   - Multiple collapse/expand cycles\n\n2. **team-issues-create.spec.ts** - Creating issues in team\n3. **team-issues-filters.spec.ts** - Filtering team issues\n4. **team-issues-filters-advanced.spec.ts** - Advanced filters\n5. **team-issues-bulk-actions.spec.ts** - Bulk operations\n6. **team-issues-row.spec.ts** - Individual issue row\n\n---\n\n### 7. Seed Data\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Teams Created:**\n1. **Engineering** (ENG)\n   - Description: \"Core product engineering team\"\n   - Members: Alice, Bob, Carol (3 members)\n   - Active Cycle: \"Sprint 12\" (status: active)\n   - Issues: 8 issues with various statuses\n\n2. **Design** (DES)\n   - Description: \"Product design and UX team\"\n   - Members: Alice, Carol (2 members)\n   - Issues: 3 design-related issues\n\n**Members:**\n- **Alice Johnson** (alice@acme.com) - admin role\n- **Bob Smith** (bob@acme.com) - member role\n- **Carol Davis** (carol@acme.com) - member role\n\n**Password**: `password123` (for all seed users)\n\n---\n\n### 8. Netlify Functions (API Endpoints)\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/teams.ts`\n\n**Endpoints:**\n\n**GET /api/teams** - Fetch all teams\n- Returns: `{ teams: Team[] }`\n- Team includes: id, name, identifier, description, member_count, active_cycle_name\n\n**GET /api/teams/{teamId}** - Fetch team details\n- Returns: `{ team: TeamDetail, members: TeamMember[], availableMembers: TeamMember[] }`\n\n**POST /api/teams** - Create new team\n- Body: `{ name, identifier, description }`\n- Validates: name required, identifier 2-5 chars, unique identifier\n- Returns: `{ team: Team }`\n\n**PUT /api/teams/{teamId}** - Update team\n- Body: `{ name?, identifier?, description? }`\n- Validates: same as create\n- Returns: `{ team: TeamDetail }`\n\n**DELETE /api/teams/{teamId}** - Delete team\n- Cascades: deletes team_members, cycles, reassigns issues\n- Returns: `{ success: true }`\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-members.ts`\n\n**POST /api/team-members** - Add member to team\n- Body: `{ teamId, memberIdToAdd }`\n- Returns: `{ member: TeamMember }`\n\n**DELETE /api/team-members** - Remove member from team\n- Body: `{ teamId, memberIdToRemove }`\n- Returns: `{ success: true }`\n\n---\n\n### 9. Database Schema (Teams Related)\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/schema.ts`\n\n**Tables:**\n\n**workspaces**\n```sql\n- id: UUID (Primary Key)\n- name: TEXT\n- default_team_id: UUID (FK → teams)\n```\n\n**teams**\n```sql\n- id: UUID (Primary Key)\n- name: TEXT (NOT NULL)\n- identifier: TEXT (NOT NULL, UNIQUE)\n- description: TEXT (Optional)\n```\n\n**team_members** (Junction table)\n```sql\n- team_id: UUID (FK → teams, CASCADE delete)\n- member_id: UUID (FK → members, CASCADE delete)\n- PRIMARY KEY: (team_id, member_id)\n```\n\n**members**\n```sql\n- id: UUID (Primary Key)\n- name: TEXT\n- email: TEXT (UNIQUE)\n- password_hash: TEXT\n- password_salt: TEXT\n- role: TEXT (admin, member)\n- created_at: TIMESTAMP\n```\n\n**cycles**\n```sql\n- id: UUID (Primary Key)\n- name: TEXT\n- start_date: DATE\n- end_date: DATE\n- team_id: UUID (FK → teams, CASCADE delete)\n- status: TEXT (active, inactive, etc.)\n```\n\n**Indexes:**\n- `idx_team_members_team_id` on team_members(team_id)\n- `idx_team_members_member_id` on team_members(member_id)\n- `idx_cycles_team_id` on cycles(team_id)\n\n---\n\n### 10. Redux State Management\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamsSlice.ts`\n\n**State Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface TeamsState {\n  items: Team[];                      // List of teams\n  selectedTeam: TeamDetail | null;   // Currently selected team\n  teamMembers: TeamMember[];         // Members of selected team\n  availableMembers: TeamMember[];    // Members not in selected team\n  loading: boolean;                  // Loading teams list\n  detailLoading: boolean;            // Loading team details\n  error: string | null;\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchTeams()` - GET /api/teams\n- `fetchTeamDetail(teamId)` - GET /api/teams/{teamId}\n- `createTeam({name, identifier, description})` - POST /api/teams\n- `updateTeam({teamId, name?, identifier?, description?})` - PUT /api/teams/{teamId}\n- `deleteTeam(teamId)` - DELETE /api/teams/{teamId}\n- `addTeamMember({teamId, memberIdToAdd})` - POST /api/team-members\n- `removeTeamMember({teamId, memberIdToRemove})` - DELETE /api/team-members\n\n**Actions:**\n- `clearTeamDetail()` - Reset selected team state\n\n---\n\n### 11. Test Documentation\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n\n**Teams Management Page Tests** (Section starting at line 2244):\n\n**TeamCard Tests:**\n- Teams page renders with list of all teams as cards\n- Team card displays team name prominently\n- Team card displays identifier prefix\n- Team card displays member count\n- Team card displays active cycle name (or \"No active cycle\")\n- Clicking a team card navigates to team settings\n- Teams page shows empty state when no teams exist\n- Teams page updates after creating a new team\n- Teams page updates after deleting a team\n\n**CreateTeamModal Tests:**\n- Create Team button opens create team modal\n- Name field is required\n- Identifier prefix is required\n- Identifier prefix must be uppercase\n- Identifier prefix must be 2-5 characters\n- Identifier prefix must be unique\n- Create team with all fields filled\n- Create team with only required fields\n- Cancel button discards input\n- Close by clicking backdrop\n- Form resets on reopen\n- Can be used multiple times in sequence\n- Submit via Enter key\n\n**TeamSettings Tests:**\n- Team settings page renders with editable fields\n- Inline edit team name\n- Inline edit team name with empty value rejected\n- Inline edit team identifier prefix\n- Inline edit team identifier enforces constraints\n- Inline edit team identifier rejects duplicate\n- Inline edit team description\n- Description can be cleared\n- Team members section lists all members\n- Add member to team\n- Add member selector shows only non-team members\n- Remove member from team\n- Cancel remove member\n- Empty state when team has no members\n- Add multiple members in sequence\n- Delete team shows confirmation\n- Confirm delete removes team and navigates back\n- Cancel delete keeps team\n- Back navigation returns to teams list\n- Team settings changes reflected in sidebar\n\n---\n\n### 12. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: './tests',\n  timeout: 60000,\n  expect: {\n    timeout: 10000,\n  },\n  fullyParallel: true,\n  forbidOnly: true,\n  retries: 0,\n  reporter: [\n    replayReporter({ upload: false }),\n    ['json', { outputFile: 'test-results/results.json' }],\n    ['html', { open: 'never' }],\n  ],\n  use: {\n    ...replayDevices['Replay Chromium'],\n    baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888',\n    actionTimeout: 15000,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Configuration Details:**\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Test timeout: 60 seconds\n- Expect timeout: 10 seconds\n- Parallel execution enabled\n- Replay.io integration for debugging\n- No retries\n- Chromium browser\n\n---\n\n### 13. File Locations Summary\n\n**Core Team Components:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Teams.tsx` - Teams page\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamCard.tsx` - Team card\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CreateTeamModal.tsx` - Create modal\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamSettings.tsx` - Settings page\n\n**Team Issues Components:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx` - Team issues page\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx` - Issues list\n\n**State Management:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamsSlice.ts` - Teams state\n\n**API:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/teams.ts` - Teams endpoints\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-members.ts` - Member endpoints\n\n**Database:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/schema.ts` - Schema definition\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` - Seed data\n\n**Tests:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/team-issues.spec.ts` - Team issues tests\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` - Test documentation (line 2244+)\n\n**Configuration:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts` - Playwright config"}],"totalDurationMs":64306,"totalTokens":80964,"totalToolUseCount":28,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1722,"cache_read_input_tokens":74921,"output_tokens":4321,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1722},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
